WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.334 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Congratulations
on your Broadway debut.

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:02.769 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thanks, man.
-This is -- This would not be

00:00:02.769 --> 00:00:04.738
that surprising for people
you've known your whole life.

00:00:04.738 --> 00:00:06.606
You were -- You did a lot
of theater growing up.

00:00:06.606 --> 00:00:08.675 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, yeah,
big, big theater kid.

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:10.777 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Did you do
any of the big plays?

00:00:10.777 --> 00:00:12.078 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Name one.
I probably did it, yeah.

00:00:12.078 --> 00:00:14.214 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"West Wide Story"?
-I was Action.

00:00:14.214 --> 00:00:15.081 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wow!
-[ Laughs ]

00:00:15.081 --> 00:00:17.017 align:start size:94% position:6%
So this is not --
And how do you feel --

00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:21.654 align:start size:94% position:6%
How's the work of doing a play
compared to doing a movie?

00:00:21.654 --> 00:00:23.390 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Compared to doing a movie?
I mean, well --

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:25.725
You know, a lot of movies, you
don't always get rehearsal time.

00:00:25.725 --> 00:00:28.094
Sometimes you -- you know,
you shake an actor's hand,

00:00:28.094 --> 00:00:29.362 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then
you're doing a scene with him.

00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:30.897 align:start size:94% position:6%
So with a play,
there's a lot more

00:00:30.897 --> 00:00:32.832 line:92%
rehearsal time, a lot more prep.

00:00:32.832 --> 00:00:34.868 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's -- I don't know.
It's a lot nicer.

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:35.702 line:92%
That's why I wanted to do it.

00:00:35.702 --> 00:00:37.937
Just to kind of feel a different
way in to what I do.

00:00:37.937 --> 00:00:40.073 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Is it exhausting?
-It is.

00:00:40.073 --> 00:00:41.841 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean,
everyone that I talked to,

00:00:41.841 --> 00:00:43.510 align:start size:94% position:6%
a lot of my actor buddies
were like,

00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:44.344 line:92%
"Ah, your whole day is free.

00:00:44.344 --> 00:00:45.512 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's only two hours
at the theater."

00:00:45.512 --> 00:00:49.416 align:start size:94% position:6%
But it's two hours.
It's such a focused two hours.

00:00:49.416 --> 00:00:51.851 align:start size:94% position:6%
You leave the theater,
and you're spent.

00:00:51.851 --> 00:00:53.119 line:92%
You just want to go back to bed.

00:00:53.119 --> 00:00:55.288 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I want to ask
about your mustache.

00:00:55.288 --> 00:00:56.556 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Also, I noticed --

00:00:56.556 --> 00:00:59.459
-I'm surprised you got a couple
questions in without asking.

00:00:59.459 --> 00:01:00.860 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, I didn't want
to make you think

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:02.462 size:75% position:38%
it's the only reason
I wanted you here.

00:01:02.462 --> 00:01:04.731 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I have a mustache.
Let's just get it out there.

00:01:04.731 --> 00:01:06.566
-We tried to book your mustache.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.566 --> 00:01:09.335 align:start size:94% position:6%
They said the only way
it could come was with you.

00:01:09.335 --> 00:01:10.770 line:92%
-He's very choosey, yeah.

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:12.439 size:88% position:44%
-But I noticed as I was
holding up the playbill,

00:01:12.439 --> 00:01:14.474
you didn't have it here.
Was this a late decision?

00:01:14.474 --> 00:01:16.242 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So...
Maybe I shouldn't be saying --

00:01:16.242 --> 00:01:17.210 line:92%
So, when I was filming --

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:21.347 align:start size:94% position:6%
We were filming "Avengers"
in Atlanta last year.

00:01:21.347 --> 00:01:22.449 align:start size:94% position:6%
And they said,
"Well, they want to come

00:01:22.449 --> 00:01:23.483 align:start size:94% position:6%
and do a photo shoot
for the play."

00:01:23.483 --> 00:01:25.085
And I said, "Well, I'm not gonna
look the way I want to look."

00:01:25.085 --> 00:01:26.119 align:start size:94% position:6%
And they said,
"Ah, it doesn't matter."

00:01:26.119 --> 00:01:27.787
It's not like -- I don't know.
I guess that's the way it is.

00:01:27.787 --> 00:01:31.224
It's okay if the photos look
different from how you look.

00:01:31.224 --> 00:01:34.027
And I said, "No, I'm gonna look
very different.

00:01:34.027 --> 00:01:37.564
I know it's just a mustache,
but it changes my whole face."

00:01:37.564 --> 00:01:39.165 line:92%
-But we were talking backstage.

00:01:39.165 --> 00:01:40.433 line:92%
It does change your whole face,

00:01:40.433 --> 00:01:43.470 size:81% position:41%
which might be helpful
for being recognized.

00:01:43.470 --> 00:01:44.938 align:start size:94% position:6%
Has it been easier
to walk around with it?

00:01:44.938 --> 00:01:48.308 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, yeah. I can look people
dead in their eyes...

00:01:48.308 --> 00:01:49.109 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.109 --> 00:01:50.677 align:start size:94% position:6%
Not only do they
not recognize me,

00:01:50.677 --> 00:01:53.780
you get some strange --
you get a little, like --

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:55.381 line:92%
You got mustache profiled.

00:01:55.381 --> 00:01:57.484
-This mustache and this haircut,
I feel, like,

00:01:57.484 --> 00:02:00.153 align:start size:94% position:6%
gives us a lot of back story
about who you are.

00:02:00.153 --> 00:02:02.856 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Now what would I be?
It's either a cop or...?

00:02:02.856 --> 00:02:03.556 size:78% position:39% line:92%
What else would I be?

00:02:03.556 --> 00:02:06.559 align:start size:94% position:6%
-A guy who tried to be a cop
and failed the test

00:02:06.559 --> 00:02:08.194 line:92%
and is super mad about it.

00:02:08.194 --> 00:02:09.129 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.129 --> 00:02:09.963 line:92%
Like, you're hoping for cop.

00:02:09.963 --> 00:02:13.066
-See, I was gonna say something
along the lines of porn.

00:02:13.066 --> 00:02:14.601 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-And I always thinks so --

00:02:14.601 --> 00:02:17.170 align:start size:94% position:6%
But it's so strange.
That's the typical response.

00:02:17.170 --> 00:02:18.471 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The funny thing --
-And it's strange

00:02:18.471 --> 00:02:21.007 align:start size:94% position:6%
that those two things, like,
live on the same street.

00:02:21.007 --> 00:02:22.408 align:start size:94% position:6%
How is it, like,
cop, porn actor?

00:02:22.408 --> 00:02:23.309 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Like, those are --

00:02:23.309 --> 00:02:27.347
- And when a cop shows up in
a porno, it's like a perfect --

00:02:27.347 --> 00:02:29.149 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's when it's like, yeah.
-Nailed it.

00:02:29.149 --> 00:02:31.217
-Nailed it.
The weird thing is Steve Rogers,

00:02:31.217 --> 00:02:34.287
Captain America, of course,
like, this looks way more

00:02:34.287 --> 00:02:36.156 align:start size:94% position:6%
like most "Steve Rogers,"
I think.

00:02:36.156 --> 00:02:36.656 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.656 --> 00:02:38.925 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, most guys named
Steve Rogers look like this.

00:02:38.925 --> 00:02:41.027 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Look like this guy.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:41.027 --> 00:02:43.997 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I want to show --
I know it's hard for all

00:02:43.997 --> 00:02:46.432 align:start size:94% position:6%
of you guys who are
in these big movies.

00:02:46.432 --> 00:02:47.567 align:start size:94% position:6%
You can't tell me
anything about it.

00:02:47.567 --> 00:02:49.402 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is spoiler city.
-Oh, yeah. I got nothing.

00:02:49.402 --> 00:02:52.105 align:start size:94% position:6%
-64 characters in this film.
-Yeah.

00:02:52.105 --> 00:02:55.208
-Let's show a clip and see
if I can get any information.

00:02:55.208 --> 00:02:55.708 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Give it a shot.

00:02:55.708 --> 00:02:57.243 align:start size:94% position:6%
-When you said
we were going to open Wakanda

00:02:57.243 --> 00:03:01.047 align:start size:94% position:6%
to the rest of the world,
this is not what I imagined.

00:03:01.047 --> 00:03:02.615 line:92%
-And what did you imagine?

00:03:02.615 --> 00:03:06.719 size:84% position:42%
-Well, the Olympics.
Maybe even a Starbucks.

00:03:06.719 --> 00:03:11.958 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:03:11.958 --> 00:03:16.362 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Air hissing,
gangway motor whirring ]

00:03:20.266 --> 00:03:22.969 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Should we bow?
-Yeah. He's a king.

00:03:22.969 --> 00:03:26.472 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Seems like I'm always
thanking you for something.

00:03:26.472 --> 00:03:29.209 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Clears throat ]
-What are you doing?

00:03:29.209 --> 00:03:32.879 line:92%
-We -- We don't do that here.

00:03:32.879 --> 00:03:33.780 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-All right.

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:37.350 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't know much about it.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:37.350 --> 00:03:41.854 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I mean,
I have one line in the clip.

00:03:41.854 --> 00:03:42.388 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:42.388 --> 00:03:44.457 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, typically, when you come
to a thing like this,

00:03:44.457 --> 00:03:46.059 align:start size:94% position:6%
you bring something
to showcase, whatever.

00:03:46.059 --> 00:03:47.694 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-But they sent me the clip,

00:03:47.694 --> 00:03:50.730
and I was like, "Is this what
I'm bringing to 'Seth Meyers'?"

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:54.901
'Cause everything I'm in
is some form of a spoiler.

00:03:54.901 --> 00:03:56.869 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So you have one.
And every talk show you go on,

00:03:56.869 --> 00:04:00.406
you're like, "Keep an eye on
the way I walk off the plane."

00:04:00.406 --> 00:04:00.940 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:04.477
"I made a very interesting
choice in my de-planing."

00:04:04.477 --> 00:04:05.578 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-A lot of preparation.

00:04:05.578 --> 00:04:07.814 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You -- Obviously,
you play Captain America.

00:04:07.814 --> 00:04:10.016 line:92%
You get a lot of action figures.

00:04:10.016 --> 00:04:12.318 align:start size:94% position:6%
This one --
They sent us a bunch.

00:04:12.318 --> 00:04:14.287 align:start size:94% position:6%
This one's my favorite...
-God.

00:04:14.287 --> 00:04:15.955 align:start size:94% position:6%
-...because of this.
Ready?

00:04:15.955 --> 00:04:17.857 align:start size:94% position:6%
Have you seen this yet?
-No.

00:04:17.857 --> 00:04:19.125 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh. Sorry.
Hold on.

00:04:19.125 --> 00:04:20.059 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Wait.

00:04:20.059 --> 00:04:22.462 align:start size:94% position:6%
See? It changes expressions.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:22.462 --> 00:04:25.398 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, it's like the, uh --
-Yeah.

00:04:25.398 --> 00:04:26.666 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Happy.
-Yeah.

00:04:26.666 --> 00:04:27.700 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Medium.
-Wait.

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:28.668 line:92%
What was the middle expression?

00:04:28.668 --> 00:04:30.737 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wait. I want to --
I got a plan here.

00:04:30.737 --> 00:04:34.474 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Chuckles ]
He's defacing my character.

00:04:34.474 --> 00:04:36.209 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, let's do --
Hold on. Wait.

00:04:36.209 --> 00:04:38.645 align:start size:94% position:6%
All right, there we go.
How would you describe it?

00:04:38.645 --> 00:04:40.079 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is angry. Right?
-Yeah, angry.

00:04:40.079 --> 00:04:43.349 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay, there we go.
That's happy dude, right?

00:04:43.349 --> 00:04:46.019 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's mustache.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:46.019 --> 00:04:49.622 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's porn-star guy.
[ Both laugh ]

00:04:49.622 --> 00:04:51.658 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, he looks --
He looks ready to go, too.

00:04:51.658 --> 00:04:53.493 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This guy,
he's very ready to go.

00:04:53.493 --> 00:04:55.662 line:92%
And how did it go afterwards?

00:04:55.662 --> 00:04:57.630 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, he's angry.
It didn't go well.

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:59.532 size:75% position:38% line:92%
Oh, now he's better.

